# Auto deploy

After finishing any code/UI change in this repo (unless the user explicitly says not to deploy):

1. Run `npm run deploy` from the project root.
2. Confirm success with the URL `http://192.168.31.11:6688/` and HTTP status.
3. Do not ask whether to deploy — just deploy.

Skip deploy only for pure questions, docs-only notes with no runtime effect, or when the user says not to.
